au3: build against a wxWidgets with wxUSE_STL

Distribution wxWidgets builds (MSYS2's among them) use wxUSE_STL=1, where
wxString has no implicit conversions to const char* / const wchar_t*.
- Give TranslatableString an untranslatable(const wxString&) overload
  (UTF-8 round trip, like au3::untranslatable()), instead of relying on
  the implicit, locale-dependent const char* conversion.
- Elsewhere convert explicitly with c_str() / wc_str(), which is what the
  implicit conversions did.

